{
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "notify_list": [],
  "title": "TP2 Tactica 2 Retry CB y concurrencia ARCA",
  "description": "Control y tratamiento con la misma instrumentacion. Artefacto para importacion manual; no validado contra una cuenta Datadog.",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "host",
      "prefix": "host",
      "defaults": [
        "tp2vmss*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "policy",
      "prefix": "policy",
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "nodes",
      "prefix": "nodes",
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Control:** policy:no_retry (protecciones desactivadas). **Tratamiento:** policy:protected (retry + CB + cupos). Seleccionar la ventana exacta de cada corrida y no ejecutar otras cargas sobre el mismo entorno. Los tags de aplicacion se incorporan con esta implementacion. **No Data no significa cero.** La retencion del log de Redis permanece en 50.000 entradas.",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "white",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "ARCA operaciones finales/s por estado",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "description": "",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": [
          "avg",
          "max",
          "value"
        ],
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "finales",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.operation.count{$host,$policy} by {status,policy}.as_rate()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "finales"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            },
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "include_zero": true,
          "scale": "linear"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "ARCA intentos/s por estado",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "description": "Incluye todos los intentos, no solamente el resultado final. No es throughput de exchanges.",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": [
          "avg",
          "max",
          "value"
        ],
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "intentos",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.validation.count{$host,$policy} by {status,policy}.as_rate()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "intentos"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            },
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "include_zero": true,
          "scale": "linear"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "ARCA errores por causa y politica/s",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "description": "Distingue HTTP 500/502/503/504, otros HTTP, red y timeout. Las causas son etiquetas acotadas, sin DNI ni IDs de operacion.",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": [
          "avg",
          "max",
          "value"
        ],
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "causas",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.validation.count{!error_type:none,$host,$policy} by {error_type,policy}.as_rate()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "causas"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            },
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "include_zero": true,
          "scale": "linear"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Indisponibilidad final remota y total (%)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "description": "No confundir menos 502 con mayor disponibilidad: tambien cuenta CB abierto y cupos agotados, que responden 503.",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": [
          "avg",
          "max",
          "value"
        ],
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "errores",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.operation.technical_error{$host,$policy} by {policy}.as_count()"
              },
              {
                "name": "indisponibles",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.operation.unavailable{$host,$policy} by {policy}.as_count()"
              },
              {
                "name": "total",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.operation.count{$host,$policy} by {policy}.as_count()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * errores / total",
                "alias": "Fallos remotos %"
              },
              {
                "formula": "100 * indisponibles / total",
                "alias": "Incluyendo rechazos locales %"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            },
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "include_zero": true,
          "scale": "linear"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Intentos por operacion ARCA",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "description": "",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": [
          "avg",
          "max",
          "value"
        ],
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "intentos",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.operation.attempts_total{$host,$policy} by {policy}.as_count()"
              },
              {
                "name": "total",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "sum:arca.operation.count{$host,$policy} by {policy}.as_count()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "intentos / total",
                "alias": "Intentos por operacion"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
